{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411180","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341118001:1":{"text":"휴식... 훈련... 휴식... 훈련... 휴식... 훈련!","source_cn":"休息……锻炼……休息……锻炼……休息……锻炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA404ACDB6CD79559","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341118002:1":{"text":"음, 또 \"훈련\"이네. 게으름을 피울 수는 없는 건가.","source_cn":"唔，还是“锻炼”啊，看来我不能再偷懒了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2EA4C6E7865BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341118003:1":{"text":"이상하네, 왜 네 송이째 꽃잎을 세는데 마지막은 항상 \"훈련\"일까?","source_cn":"好奇怪，为什么连着数了四朵花的花瓣，最后一片花瓣都是“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9ECCAD597AC4652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341118004:1":{"text":"그건... 네가 꺾는 꽃의 꽃잎이 전부 여섯 개니까 그렇지!","source_cn":"那是因为——你摘的花都是六瓣的呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7393F1F0A855CE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}